{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GIVEAWAYS!!!<i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our recent giveaway just ended on January 20th! We\u2019ll be doing more of these, so stay tuned. We\u2019ll also be doing Discord-exclusive giveaways, so make sure you join our community server. <i>(link can be found in the list of links on this steam page)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/Hoomanz-Xbox-Giveaway-Ad-Flat-v2__1_.jpg?t=1742464213\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Planet in Peril - Embrace the darkness, save Erf!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of <strong>Shoo</strong>, a mysterious, mythical creature with a hidden dual nature, in this charming casual adventure game built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>. Summoned by Grandma Nature herself, you're tasked with a crucial mission: rid planet Erf of the ignorant <strong>Hoomanz </strong>invaders! But beware - not everything on <strong>Erf </strong>is as it seems...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Light vs. Dark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between two forms of Shoo as you navigate a vibrant, bioluminescent jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Light Shoo</strong></u>: Cute and fluffy, but vulnerable in light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Dark Shoo</strong></u>: Menacing and powerful, transformed by shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to stay hidden, harness the power darkness grants you, and outsmart the Hoomanz at every opportunity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swift Movement</strong>: Quick and agile gameplay perfect for snappy, sneaky manoeuvring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laugh Out Loud</strong>: Encounter hilarious situations as you outwit the dim-witted Hoomanz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Use the darkness wisely or the Hoomanz might see you...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Problem Solving</strong>: With lots of tools at your disposal, experiment with different strategies to scare away Hoomanz and overcome challenges your own way</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfect for Casual Gamers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick-up-and-play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accessible for all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No punishing checkpoints or game-overs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156450?t=1742464213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/7f91b2b5ce96c12199b804fb48df15d7f2c388f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742464213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/ee41e619083afd80aff090a93eae4aca6506966a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742464213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/ee41e619083afd80aff090a93eae4aca6506966a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742464213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GIVEAWAYS!!!<i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our recent giveaway just ended on January 20th! We\u2019ll be doing more of these, so stay tuned. We\u2019ll also be doing Discord-exclusive giveaways, so make sure you join our community server. <i>(link can be found in the list of links on this steam page)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156450/extras/Hoomanz-Xbox-Giveaway-Ad-Flat-v2__1_.jpg?t=1742464213\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Planet in Peril - Embrace the darkness, save Erf!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of <strong>Shoo</strong>, a mysterious, mythical creature with a hidden dual nature, in this charming casual adventure game built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>. Summoned by Grandma Nature herself, you're tasked with a crucial mission: rid planet Erf of the ignorant <strong>Hoomanz </strong>invaders! But beware - not everything on <strong>Erf </strong>is as it seems...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Light vs. Dark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between two forms of Shoo as you navigate a vibrant, bioluminescent jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Light Shoo</strong></u>: Cute and fluffy, but vulnerable in light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Dark Shoo</strong></u>: Menacing and powerful, transformed by shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to stay hidden, harness the power darkness grants you, and outsmart the Hoomanz at every opportunity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swift Movement</strong>: Quick and agile gameplay perfect for snappy, sneaky manoeuvring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laugh Out Loud</strong>: Encounter hilarious situations as you outwit the dim-witted Hoomanz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Use the darkness wisely or the Hoomanz might see you...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Problem Solving</strong>: With lots of tools at your disposal, experiment with different strategies to scare away Hoomanz and overcome challenges your own way</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfect for Casual Gamers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick-up-and-pla